2117
01:00:03,400 --> 01:00:06,160
rikkub kiiruslimiiti.

2118
01:00:06,200 --> 01:00:07,960
"ja see lahendab probleemi."

2119
01:00:06,200 --> 01:00:07,960
"ja see lahendab probleemi."

